ed_at":"2026-01-29T18:16:19Z"},"body":"This is an attempt to address [#110489](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110489)\r\n\r\n* Added `bool p_is_guard` parameter to `resolve_node`, `reduce_expression`, `resolve_suite` and `reduce_call`\r\n* From `resolve_match_branch` I pass `true` into `resolve_suite` when handling the guard_body\r\n* In reduce_call I don't raise an error if `p_is_guard=true`\r\n\r\nExample of warning being called for an unconsumed return as opposed to guard pattern:\r\n<img width=\"425\" height=\"200\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8f2fb0c-cfc4-4cbd-a6b1-bbf02770e78b\" />\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n\r\n* Fixes #110489.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/